<p>When switching targets your rime wraith now always prefers the one farther away if possible.</p><p>Any creatures on the path of the wraith while it travels are affected:</p><ul><li> if friendly: they are healed for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">28, 38, 46, 52, 58</acronym></li><li> if hostile: they take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">59, 79, 95, 108, 120</acronym> cold damage, because the wraith is inside the creature the damage fully ignores any damage shield</li></ul><p>The damage and healing will increase with your Spellpower.</p>